      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is Quibble's face and upper costume shown in <Picture 1> and <Picture 2>, including the exact long angular facial structure, swept black hair, heavy eyebrows, burgundy collar and restrained personality.\n<Subject 2> is the close-up headquarters background shared by both pictures, including the CRT rim, warm lamp and brass globe.\n<Picture 1> is the neutral opening expression and composition for [Shot 1].\n<Picture 2> is the restrained final smirk and composition for [Shot 1].\n\nsummary:\n[identity reference + expression transition] Generate one continuous four-second static-camera close-up. Preserve all identity, costume, lighting and background. Change only the neutral expression into the small smirk.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved - face identity, hair, head position and costume remain fixed while the mouth corner and eyelids change minimally.\n<Subject 2>: fully_preserved - the background and lighting remain fixed.\n<Picture 1>: fully_preserved - opening expression and composition.\n<Picture 2>: fully_preserved - final expression and composition.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] Elegant stylized 3D CG animation, perfectly static close-up. Quibble begins from <Picture 1>, almost completely still. One closed-mouth corner rises slowly and his eyes narrow by a fraction, progressively reaching the restrained smirk in <Picture 2>. There is no dialogue, eyebrow flourish, head movement, nod, camera motion, text or added object.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nLow CRT hum and quiet room tone continue with one subtle controlled breath.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"
      ],
